== Utilities and Frameworks

#mod-entry(
  name: "Private Message Terminal (LE1)",
  url: "https://www.nexusmods.com/masseffectlegendaryedition/mods/1525",
  game: "LE1",
  version: "v1.4",
  last-checked: "2026-07",
  deps: ("ME3Tweaks Mod Manager",),
  impact: [Adds a private message terminal to the Normandy SR-1's control center and captain's office. Serves as a messaging framework for other mod authors to add emails, mission updates, and interactive messages to the game. Supports conditional triggers, plot consequences, XP/credit rewards, and player choice responses (authorize vs. ignore). Used by Eclectic Emails, ME1 Dossiers Restored, and other mods.],
  notes: none,
)

