== Audio and Sound

#mod-entry(
  name: "Mako Squadmate Banter",
  url: "https://www.nexusmods.com/masseffectlegendaryedition/mods/1310",
  game: "LE1",
  version: "v1.2",
  last-checked: "2026-07",
  deps: ("LE1 Community Patch",),
  impact: [Takes the elevator banter conversations between squadmates and plays them periodically while driving the Mako on uncharted worlds. Banter plays at random intervals with customizable timing via the in-game Mod Settings Menu. Does not play during main story Mako sections or combat. Supports all voiced game languages.],
